{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30003_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b6c21103f5bea4129adb1d8b77a596bee8aa71394ee841cf810f5a4435493ccd",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000030:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07d9d20a6e345d1232f3e3b7c104e1112ecee527b513b61376fca0e575d7868d",
      "text": "冬美家·客厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64225cbc7cd61f948f9fdcf3a313f2447205375d8b783d3a99459c5793c36339",
      "text": "你们就是和旬一起\n做偶像活动的孩子们吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2ef591619bab164c926a8cd59bce9d7c3b6840367a661d0c5d72cfdf5fe104b",
      "text": "是的。我们作为名为High×Joker的\n团体在进行活动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1a64a3452e4a7ee1ef407a6fc4559bd9e1daf26ed36decf7b9e78abe1b19a9e",
      "text": "果然夏来君也在一起啊。\n我心里多少猜到了些。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:392d8c3d0a8fa3d86b87d0777553f82f3af2fa5390b4684de3c622c67f5decf9",
      "text": "罢了，那些暂且不论。\n话说回来，你们全都是高中生吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54b709829f0d3ea5c47f939deff632d8ad8e836a9c414eee453ce0c5b8d0e424",
      "text": "考虑到升学考试，你们也别把时间浪费在\n这种玩闹上了，专心于学业如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed07c0134d9a906baa78c6e3c3effc6603f701b4183d0748836dd96169e1e7aa",
      "text": "请等一下！\n我们绝不是抱着玩玩的心态在做的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd2a56288dd9d4a72e44c46e4840683801c9e65e1f71bdb2ffb72175b9636b0c",
      "text": "我们是真……认真地打算以偶像的身份\n出人头地！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac5c9e612d709799b133e1e7e3009ef8048b363376a9acac57a589de71b43071",
      "text": "我们所有人都是认真的。\n请理解我们的这份心意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c61a4cf8d8ec174c1df7839240d1a74a42c1527d0e4fdd3c5b57e25234d0d85",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:047cd6fb4c000b38d8e0b424ec89b9d00a509851de47a571cbebd60e47c1fa28",
      "text": "……旬和我们，对待偶像都是真心的……\n请您，相信我们……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a5b15d2b681d57f2871a910fff38463a7e277e95fb823a0873b290a405c089d",
      "text": "……父亲，我是认真的。\n我想试着看看，我们5个人到底能走到多远。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30003_01:1_3_30003_01_i:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5126e61bbbb460fbf5193256aad13bf9ff11ff0495b64fcb9d580ba6ae2f3148",
      "text": "我……想和大家一起把偶像做下去！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
